    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, it feels like there's no \"me\" left to step back. even when i'm not working, i'm just thinking about how i have to be ready for the next thing. it's like the system has already used up everything i am. everything feels so empty and pointless, like i'm just waiting for something to happen that never will.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
